{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1310,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55761f14ffd9812d4e87a6dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0f0665e0a69c08888c3252e4588492414e62eb2a101e0b2a5a81f3189d824bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ebadf1bd748fc9054704d5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e23a2a933be63f7992ef78dc97543046307e6306c1a546d698062edb79747a91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbf11245ec45390fd20576fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fda4bd33d622bd98ca587ee7d715a334c1539d637bda2840b8a8e6b90025e5cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2749c2823e0d5cb8a957b56f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "预计明天可以拿到这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f736f5663f41f1d199bdafd565909c0dec41a49cede4d0749591e795e9fc95d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b22e8640d82940f2ac393204",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……感觉身体有点沉重呢。\r\n是否该稍微调整一下行程比较好……",
      "source_fingerprint": "66fddf4714ca7ef26f922dca540a182a94b2591d1b33e09dd19c3e5228d7be24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17f52c6db1aea2c65003baa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来有必要制定休息的时间呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b63a93706ae8892f1b7cc99283fafd2ae02e5a8c56b10ec3e644872e5162d83d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bf7ad9fbc41e7274c125c62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是绝佳状态吧……呵呵。\r\n多亏了你的指导，\r\n才让我有办法依照行程做事呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "251f2a2000ce65064422a1a177fd062e1f5f168be6f53c0381236151cc33cbe7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaf0c6a77c7304ddc7871889",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的状态非常好。\r\n再来就只需要照计划进行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "acdd76f7cc0c39be9e971cf31c1dbb33fb369105991c7be99b7ab78b9eab8f24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f648a25c3ec9a4048ddc3c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉不错……\r\n应该能获得预期的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfa20357445f83abb749ea62cd07ba305c1d57d8330129601170d231d5c03b89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aca910de735c9152e726b7bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我们就按照计划开始吧。\r\n感觉会是一场充实的训练呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c562743686fbfa217561dbefe8ef2bf54cda0f8fe533f43127f6508c70dd8b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb2b115c7bb2222888df99af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态很好。\r\n应该能按照计划完成训练项目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53153d0407532cee0960e9b19bf38c3874b683355d86b70b830c6129f4bfedd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0cd31c4cf17349b5b25397b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "依照现在的步调，\r\n目前的行程应该都没有问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5966a49c18b70fe9c4b7c757df8d18c319166f1323405ac69ccccd2b73de59e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9216a932bd8173e32950769a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不知道怎么了……感觉有点倦怠……\r\n或许是需要稍做调整……",
      "source_fingerprint": "516a447f9a18300f572768307d46fa6285c8a5329013b3a54d5031edfe000a38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b43b842a94f671e45963c5de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天本来计划好要训练的……\r\n可是身体却有点沉重。",
      "source_fingerprint": "613bb363b41d08eb31d1e8bfe543adc56ce9f01636e9afd8a4cb8b7a0a13960d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1c5a2a266f6692283f30231",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……\r\n总觉得连尾巴都变得毛躁起来了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "754168780dfa0df1b9bcaea2b8f7350f4d9e2d2030cfb91c8a4bc2a154792dd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0a5f22646daafd505d66f83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像没办法调整好状态呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "acb376ec3077af84a4ab7c57a36398c0959a106d756c00d158c0aef91e5be4ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6be2967b26bb82d144963c6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……今天也要参赛的话，\r\n以行程安排来说有点太勉强了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b429fb0b2707b97bde8940c376295e184b40728eaa728dde9b5c665c59692c57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc9a0f22d1d584045cf1da25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直这样连续参赛的话，\r\n会影响到之后的行程的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "94bdcf3451d196defc8c48ecf70347bbd0ddb6acd7fa378662204f3131851153",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72fd9854b5be1a41ebbec0a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Sturm und Drang……！\r\n老实说我现在感到很雀跃……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "06bd22cc2324d78dcc7febe5d46d3f9535010b10f23e7adf9547ecb57639fd4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b28bead42b093e1405114f2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "分毫不差地执行计划……\r\n完全是理想中的状态。\r\n感觉可以顺利地取得胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "129255acc2e5995c182c3a61ce76740519378ec3fb61358b4e6742abf219393c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcf8e396ca22763bfc73c219",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不枉费我们花时间一起制定计划呢。\r\n……那我这就去完成我们的目标了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82a6af74cc684b388e595c8945647f45f05bf83cd82363772a1447a0b01763c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:449f62c560d30a48396889b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "体能状态良好、精神状态良好、\r\n尾巴的修剪也没问题……\r\n可以说是准备万全的状态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f08be57feeb44bfdbba0475781a9ac201f45877be2a998925fc341800330c1be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5766bba807e1fec4ab9a022f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "顺利依照计划以良好的状态迎战呢。\r\n再来就只需要跑出好成绩了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8525d4d46d65d5aac35173928466b0fc0206f00dd78f6606170ada24c760976",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57536e59cf2a33bf62e6344f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为有你，才顺利调整到好的状态。\r\n我一定不会辜负你的期望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8c75ecb3bbcf1316202e1f47b50ef636ad8017a5057e9ea1c0be9b5a66770e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adcead977668181a5dd4198b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……请不用担心。\r\n我会证明这一路以来，\r\n我们所做的事情都是正确的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e72829c52028d72ea2f1695e85e1552c4768cd11cb184fba9189fbb5c641e2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:851cb377de624cb685c27e6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "toi、toi、toi……好。\r\n那就上场吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5417f8ed1020110be59d8f22682e260639b2ab7722de2a398f4630541f74c46d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e12d1dce1f71b233b874fcc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一切几乎都依照计划进行呢。\r\n我有十足的把握能够达成目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04d15c7c80e9ade5493915ef1164c3af3a6865fa2ad008f43b810eeb229d32e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb13db4fad5e8a6ee215e5f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然不是最完美的状态……\r\n但我并没有迷失目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85d9210d27887c41bbd3892703ea36d442ae7131553278a2b4c70f8d24713594",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1c590b31c73e0c86907ec0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然计划有些被打乱了，\r\n但……还是有补救的可能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cebf0f82b980a7fb32696ffee73de4ba070d6de0be221e13a10790e27bdfd19a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de3be3cc60e742a1396a355d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目前的状态确实不好呢……\r\n但总之我会全力以赴的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93a61f55823373779c942db4c58af0d0890eec1c83b639f987fa64510f70aa1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e9387d76c7a91ff7c3162e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是预料之外的状况……\r\n但在沮丧之前，\r\n还要先好好应战才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c8945a15f921494de2f818817f437347c926969057213e96ee3e56e8a72b236",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:226ffc8b385ef05842fdf96d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在只希望能跑完全程，\r\n不给父母丢脸……只能如此了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95a57573161696a41ffa87a6ac8f17d3226720164c91383f4d6212af261f2229",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cdea8a0e5dca842384b6098",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直没办法集中注意力……\r\n但也不是不能参赛的地步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b335167479114e89ae848d66eaa391c9c3d174879470d1b54672ee1564463c2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53ca51e1846bff3668723d55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我要上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "020a28a15128f0c8bf2a4dcfc7b524be5f099c6fc021f403031b7d144ea2fab4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb4d612f2bda8cb3d15f202e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c66460a5c14710b1e38adcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会集中精神的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28f29f715977690595dfd16ee28e069f8cdfcb5a782163bf55f7f1bd0a5f42fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fa194d9647351126f3b4faa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这很基本。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c24f6a000981dee56b3890a9a6e9bb39a36ec7a0bc4432d24730d00691cad9b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32706993e070bd509c2cc593",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是难以置信……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "943aa1696bfe28d3edf1f9e2a381f36f02a2064ef5b850f66f4617ba8030a031",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6be3dc97695679619e8cf5cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a60f7567ee57a44a6c7a81ce7c92760716260a4c839641ce043422c08ecd1996",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08517675986647319569243f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我们就一起吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcadd4eac8898db2b58c855946dfd6eed0659fac4a82ec14e32d3feaaf37d9e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1f9074ed6256a198570a747",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉非常期待……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "963f96f40a1a0fa59abef4794ad90d9f7b8f065535aa9d006f53e65c8810b2b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fc58acf68367f2b02a80021",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对你的指导深感敬意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c733c333320aea37c1a453630fd57fb7533273b24edc29d0407bf85bbfa30f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9a998c2475b619308211c25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很感谢一直以来你为我的付出。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec90dd33cb5915cbd92cebd5538333b21c9fe483bb20bc057d6a9fdde58ac07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a678de1032dbdcfca912b710",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是训练的时间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d62a522c7a4e5575b0a28661c3a49ec840425e33279a6efc1397ed1ab5cf1bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fadf328be38d7bfa6594b947",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位，时间到了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c87e9eb87deafea0d4cdcac9258220f7746586b3cda302a4cc9fb9f4d2bcc9fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bed1e7560983f5d7c21299a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽力做到Beste吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e07ee8aedee8f3acd6f30b859ac861abd4b9e4e7040cb2e4eec01dd4acf236e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4afd6adc4a1672152c66e2d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很感谢一直以来你为我的付出。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec90dd33cb5915cbd92cebd5538333b21c9fe483bb20bc057d6a9fdde58ac07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83edc9bb384339f440330cd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "顺利依照计划以良好的状态迎战呢。\r\n再来就只需要跑出好成绩了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8525d4d46d65d5aac35173928466b0fc0206f00dd78f6606170ada24c760976",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:659e024d8cb47bd1bc050df3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不枉费我们花时间一起制定计划呢。\r\n……那我这就去完成我们的目标了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82a6af74cc684b388e595c8945647f45f05bf83cd82363772a1447a0b01763c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddac5f235c7782a0a7ef97b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很感谢一直以来你为我的付出。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec90dd33cb5915cbd92cebd5538333b21c9fe483bb20bc057d6a9fdde58ac07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:336f1bd0df5a71d7f1752094",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f65feadc5df3a67388e0b0611e8001d48fdc3726284e5fc828766adeb5793e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:091a2f83af7d6cf134bf5ba3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是一场值得骄傲的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10ffba2dc98ccc659fff9de5bbafcd28c95d28bf1a7d0a2123d717242d2e9299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b0b3cbb20147c04f26bd456",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勉强合格……下次得再更好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "864d554b5c4022ba22e87d55e554f28d77318cb6b5ed5942791535521400cbdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d8d7f2ec9a0411dea663df4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要更仔细安排好行程才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "df384c1ab3a4f5788a39ea9eda6f41546167cdefca4d3dd9a9b64a83607c9614",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2ccfeca232c0183cfe1e612",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来……必须重新审视计划才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a02c626c3235c241734efbd642675765d71f025567976b2d3beda0df11e857c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dffc87baaeb9d674fe28444f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和你一起拟定的行程……\r\n没有分毫的差错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7591268ed862408b955f9a3a25c116187b2561c135cb2de38c7e45c10dfc9b7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c34a6dcb5732cd91c87a9a2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "达成目的……我跑出了好成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f25e0bbdd2a6a8603b0dbe44c9e0251e5b27fbff25f3e5d3c5fb0d84a9dde9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e5ea8f02146571cd1d535a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "依循胜利的食谱……\r\n有了美味的成果呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8949b1171090b959e7e3325106134875bb58c54cfedbdb682761efa1958d2b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12e5a926e37393c95f96e6c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "达成目的……我跑出好成绩了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c03026e29eeefe3d31b8629ff3ca0973dad49305083310ccfe2954358996c82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:306ff3ad3710beb106f15973",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "余韻に浸りながら、クールダウンを…ふぅ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ebeaad0e9e7eaf8690cb21f4b101150dc1254a23a73f025e140da42db0f68bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61650d166883316dbabedc12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目的を達成…いい走りができました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9df6e674fa0bd5e8d5fec9548f31e29d72772cef35a6631c67162327126a80eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58ca2dfb99fff724651976f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Auf geht's！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c8a565e5d47114cceb25f32a796120e0d1bc40b7e1c5d4d0f4b3358dc378732",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56f10167f756e70269e7296e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在就是展现成果的时候！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c745f5aab2f2e3728fb3019f8a743a71e865592b560f28de1840f458ddf02284",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12de76c7c16f8e0d31165403",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用完美的步骤进行完美的食谱，\r\n是我作为平日感谢的证明。\r\n我一定会赢得这次的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af7d5329e62e71f56b4ecd748daaae61fdd660cd20be885d484b77b8082e0b85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd959ed9200c6a226586437c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "时间有限。\r\n必须迅速找出能触动\r\n人心的合适主题才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7facfe24c2277a929c078f21f38c96b9613228bc0805d3ab2f27f3e04730a088",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:964c547068ea2699326c3fc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ファルコンさんは、道行く人に手を\r\n振られるとファンサしてしまうので\r\n移動時間は余裕をもって長めに…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3d9c187297dc53d7649ddcef739d62155f3cd246e9385ab130130be792f75b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd1e6e32fe50ee1932936406",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感受这所学园的精髓……\r\nWunderbar──\r\n令人不禁发出赞叹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ae73f24d0657d00d4218494c7d516c53b728a7dc1bf74484d8a9b60dbd297f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:864cab116b26c43ae341801c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在此献上对特雷森学园的敬意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22827eddfc230eea879a0b4a3a87cd4bb92e07bb0ef15267437fe4e8607e7a49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05a99085246fa33c6ae66c25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "通往胜利的每一步都稳妥确实……\r\n现在就是展现成果的时候！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22e1275e61a41082c97021fc710610bdcc3308d120853012a1a86450869f4fa6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:482ad3e6573091153266d2b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然结果令人遗憾，但我想\r\n对父母说我得到了宝贵的经验。\r\n……下次绝对要扳回一城。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7fa0fc0e0b7efca9c4548aa53f26c58afb86e7b3f0b2b8b17da170ea87ec398",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d921251a4888ee45c996c283",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这里是活动任务。\r\n内容五花八门，\r\n建议要有缜密的计划。",
      "source_fingerprint": "612e2bfe1f4e993339ad59a81df768be836caa7de366d838d83945dc14d08422",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69ae79e368e37c184f6147f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是报酬。\r\n可别忘了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc0089b8dfe6644f9366942dbdd4b0402f40cd977e9a81650aa2ced57d70524d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a7de21cb728a04188f823eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帰る前に、ドイツの両親へ絵葉書を\r\n送りました。この地の消印入りの…\r\nふふ、貴方もいかがですか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "203bc46be0838d785a49927eaff680f77f17e46f25b4c4b2b66eba0a1c08259c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e18c03b3b0c5f34006634df3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请享用层层迭加后的滋味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "acb86c549faf81bd603577ff0fa7757da991cf0be648590171b74744767c6d04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f24cae282572ab14abf6d30e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食谱、份量、调理……都很完美。\r\n请享用层层迭加后的滋味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ffdf38145a5e5d2b395cfb4b30afb4f557e31ad7f4b68f78b12d8449fa4da6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c44a522076ca0c2736d12e29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『なにもしない』という予定も\r\nたまにはいいものです。少し\r\n落ち着かないのがまた、非日常で。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6cf3ac65f7e9316522ad029c3be8308aa71e7fe46c2316d0b87b891fd17b764",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "400082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb9f49fc1161888caddb5598",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "予定にはない、予想外を――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5b7cd6770a03779705ec84ec5857f4a01821e58fcf2d4fbe7ec275eb99add4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e327079580eafe10e87c9285",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スケジュール、確保しました。\r\nさあ、楽しみましょう。\r\n予定にはない、予想外を――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c65c66e89c8a580cd64441fec7fe307b0d89ba214004b3e74ceb3ce1eff0db5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a864090ed1b10eccc1f0c13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要去对支持我的人们表达感谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a166541632a6e1858d1bd6b3d467542cf10b5283a87d2e8c953cbe2248b0b791",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da4c2d174c4d1f38ab0ce933",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有点紧张。\r\ntoi、toi、toi……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a276e9a26575e9f0ae711c43d45c3c1c6b545171c30673cc848a5e3abbb30ca6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "60001"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
